    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Modify\r\n\r\nThis program checks whether each number from 2 to 5 is even or odd — but the same `if/else` block is copy-pasted four times.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n\r\nReplace the repetition with a `while` loop.",
